# Normally you need NO .env file: the SPA defaults to the same-origin
# relative base "/api" (nginx on :80 serves both the SPA and the API — the
# locked topology). In `npm run dev`, Vite proxies /api and /static to
# http://localhost:80, so streaming (X-Accel-Redirect) works in dev too.

# Override ONLY for the backend-container-less dev flow from
# docs/onboarding.md ("Run locally (without the backend container)"):
# backend directly on :8000, no nginx. Media streaming does NOT work in
# that mode — X-Accel-Redirect only resolves through nginx.
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000
